  "id": "automated-assessment",
  "term": "automated assessment",
  "definition": "Automated assessment is the use of computer-based methods, such as image processing and supervised machine learning, to detect and measure features without direct manual scoring. In this source, it means classifiers that analyze digital biopsy images to identify and quantify steatosis automatically.",
